  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.22 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.36. Exact attention on the tensor cores is now the DEFAULT wherever PreciseActivations is on (CUDA cards with tensor cores, head width 128): q, k, v and the probabilities as hi + lo bf16 halves, keys centred; LTX-2's video self-attention 3x faster (140 -> 47 ms), a precise LTX-2 call's GPU work 34 -> 24 s; settled by a three-seed clip test (it moves a clip less than changing backend does) and 16 ComfyUI gates. Off: DiTKernels.DefaultExactTensorCoreAttention = false or env TRELLIS2_MMA_EXACT_ATTN=0; Ltx2Pipeline.ExactTensorCoreAttention now passes false through. LTX-2 speed switches on Ltx2Pipeline (PreciseActivations, HostCacheBytes, ReadAheadBytes), streamed blocks upload straight from pooled host images. Ltx2Transformer.ComfyPatchedFp8WeightsAsync: the ComfyUI-compatible fp8 LoRA mode's patched weights read back; they match ComfyUI's stored weights on blocks 1 and 42 (3.7e-6 of elements one fp8 step apart, scales bit-equal). Full notes: CHANGELOG.md.",
